{"3385970":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Beyond Sandbox","steam_appid":3385970,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Beyond Sandbox!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback is instrumental in shaping our roadmap. There is so much planned and we're excited to see everything our modding community builds alongside us. This is just the beginning.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3385970\/extras\/a89526efb641d71f424d6e20bb20db38.poster.avif?t=1778514258\" width=614 height=202 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3385970\/extras\/a89526efb641d71f424d6e20bb20db38.mp4?t=1778514258\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond Sandbox is a multiplayer VR modding platform powered by Unreal Engine 5. With advanced physics, detailed VR interactions and the creativity of our modding community, anything is possible.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Advanced Physics Sandbox<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced physics based interactions in both single-player and multiplayer! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3385970\/extras\/3649457fcd1be076f58e25e3e1acf22a.poster.avif?t=1778514258\" width=614 height=202 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3385970\/extras\/3649457fcd1be076f58e25e3e1acf22a.mp4?t=1778514258\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics is more fun with friends.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline po